        "authorName": "pagnchanak",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Andromi Auto"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Android Auto on the phone, shown on a Xiaomi car screen"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Andromi Auto runs Android Auto on your phone and shows it in its own window, so HyperOS\n\"Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" can mirror it to the car screen.\n\n* Self mode: no USB cable or wireless head unit needed\n* Material 3 design with wallpaper (Monet) colours\n* Portrait and landscape switch for the different car window sizes\n* Optional automatic start when the car's Bluetooth connects (needs root setup)\n* Built-in update check for stable releases\n\nBased on Open Headunit (AGPL-3.0). Unofficial; not affiliated with Google, Xiaomi or Baidu.\nUses the install id com.baidu.searchbox, so it cannot be installed next to the real Baidu app."
        },
