        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Unofficial app for the Xiaomi.EU community forum"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "XEU Forums is an unofficial Android app for the Xiaomi.EU community forum.\n\n* Browse every forum and thread in a clean Material 3 design, in light and dark mode\n* Search threads and posts, and jump to new posts\n* My devices: follow the phones you own and get one feed of their forums\n* Log in, reply, quote and start threads, and switch between several accounts\n* Alerts, direct messages and watched threads inside the app\n* Notifications for forum alerts and new direct messages\n\nNot affiliated with Xiaomi or Xiaomi.EU."
        },
